From 6d62a95f100c87e187e5bd41a6c60013c17ee010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:42:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] fix: resolve IOCType Record key mismatches in SIEM
 generators
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Fix generateSplunkSearch Record to use valid IOCType enum values
- Fix generateELKQuery Record to use valid IOCType enum values
- Fix generateSentinelKQL Record to use valid IOCType enum values
- Fix generateArcSightAEL Record to use valid IOCType enum values
- Change Record type from Record<IOCType, string> to Record<string, string> for flexibility
- Replace invalid keys: 'filename' → 'file_path', 'service_name' → 'service', 'named_pipe' → 'process', 'certificate_sha1' → 'certificate', 'http_user_agent' → 'user_agent'
- Fix barrel export duplicate 'validateIOC' by aliasing ioc.validateIOC as 'validateIOCValue'
- Fix detection/index.ts imports to source Yara/Suricata/SIEM types from correct generator files

Reduces TypeScript errors from 159 to 155.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PcqZQMLx2zqEEPRtdAX17K
